{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ba29376169717904128c0ab6900b13443242f32920837dd085f0223d4d56481d", "ja": "（新しい仕事のオファーが来たんだけど……\n肝心の可奈はどこだろう？　姿が見えないな）", "zh": "（收到了新的工作邀约……\n但身为主角的可奈在哪里？没看见她呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "f1af7c5008292809a3016b821e164330ed78ef4160b3319cd1c421b6c5a2f60a", "ja": "綿あめ～あまあま～♪\n食べたら～ふわふわ～♪　えへへっ。", "zh": "棉花糖～甜蜜蜜～♪\n咬一口～软绵绵～♪嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d0112ed7003e669efd20f1b8742c494038cafa919b3d650633eea12bda4f0898", "ja": "お、いたいた。\n可奈、ずいぶん楽しそうだな。何かあったのか？", "zh": "啊，找到了。\n可奈，看你好像很开心，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "f723ed799dbd2e96ec367f6e9bfc887800c2169eaea96926004ecf230906bd29", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nそうなんですよ～、聞いてください♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n没有错喔～请你听我说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "2aa34d815f5135824105657c435a683b7435c61e2f0f8ba1935b9e29271510de", "ja": "さっき志保ちゃんに、綿あめをもらったんです！\nふわふわでとっても甘くて、おいしいんですよ～。", "zh": "刚才志保送棉花糖给我！\n又软又甜，很好吃喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b4f1f848cc42522521eabac428e5bb592557eef1984b48d67ea826ee385675b2", "ja": "へえ、志保が？\n綿あめなんて珍しいな。どうしたんだろう？", "zh": "哦，志保吗？\n她会送你棉花糖还真稀奇，是怎么了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "d40b2d803298f76c92466dd7fcf1e1e6f9df6af680bf34c3df76cd2a936d0afd", "ja": "志保ちゃんが弟くんと一緒に縁日で買ったんだけど、\nこんなに食べられないからーって。", "zh": "听说是志保跟弟弟一起去庙会买的，\n但买太多了，他们吃不完。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "de0aede61e5c18487464773ae6b95c08682e9ed729f678f1967140e195c46201", "ja": "「可奈はお菓子が好きだし、すこしならいいでしょ」\nって。志保ちゃん、優しいですよね～。えへへ。", "zh": "志保说「反正可奈喜欢吃糖果，分你一点没关系吧」，\n她人很好吧～嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "50bb037ed0c17e93bcab14c5687405c3fffa7685e865d4c2ff3a970132fbea02", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、一緒に食べませんか？\nふわふわのあまあまで、すっごくおいしいですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生要不要也一起吃？\n软绵绵又甜蜜蜜的，非常好吃喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fffcaff1b30fe5916ec60d9f5ee893b7060910313c8dbd8786523c185dde4ff0", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。\n……うん、やっぱり可奈がいいな。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。\n……嗯，果然选可奈是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "f113fb0c6844e2662600927e482a2596098910687578bb316762c13d91baaa6a", "ja": "？　{$P$}さん、\n私がいいって、何がですか？", "zh": "？\n{$P$}先生，什么选我是对的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1011_p", "source_sha256": "346dfa81d4325fce0201ccb0a344f92ec8f3b8de3dcc4bb9cf56baeaf58447e5", "ja": "いや、実はバレンタインキャンペーンの\n仕事の依頼があったんだ。", "zh": "没什么，\n就是接到了情人节宣传活动的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1012_p", "source_sha256": "69dc843bc8102e1c70493cdd05cb54f1f33a34c7608c6696060bf539eface9bb", "ja": "可奈は、お菓子が好きだろ？\nせっかくだから、可奈にやってもらおうかと思ってな。", "zh": "可奈你喜欢糖果吧？\n难得有这个机会，我想让你负责这份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "29cac26ef2c48069f8c2cd53990321bb8d84c2bf9fd3ee8f6bcbfd39c9e3836c", "ja": "えーっ！？　それ、ホントですか！？\nやった、やった～♪", "zh": "咦──！？你是说真的吗！？\n太好了、太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1014_p", "source_sha256": "120a8eb991a832cb31bb31da2831a5dfaefb3ca014a1c1a1197328c1b390ea5c", "ja": "結構、大規模なキャンペーンで、\nイベントやCM撮影なんかもするそうだ。", "zh": "那是还挺大型的宣传活动，\n好像还会举办实体活动跟拍广告。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "5a73ebf7db7dd2b5705f7b6cce5cad27c5fb0b09a15835d5f90098a531ad5724", "ja": "お菓子のCMのお仕事か～、どんな内容なんだろ？\nお菓子の家とか、作ったりしないかな～？", "zh": "要拍糖果广告啊～会是什么样的内容呢？\n会不会盖糖果屋之类的呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "e19a222dfa417762bb2a8dea1174dd53a33eee38c33019a73cecee98fe462fc0", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　この綿あめが、\n全部お風呂の泡だったら素敵ですよね！", "zh": "啊，对了！要是这些棉花糖\n全部变成浴池里的泡泡，那一定很棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3758277f30537b6a06ae32d8232b801962dc72f06956b161517089257ecbe96", "ja": "壁は全部、クッキーとかチョコレートで……。\nあ～あ、お菓子の家に住みたいな～。な～♪", "zh": "墙壁全部都是饼干或巧克力……\n啊～啊，好想住在糖果屋里啊～啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dd9894d5a96d3e351797107f7fa9b29a920261b09658f799fcf521c269af09ee", "ja": "お風呂の泡……なんだか、べとべとになりそうだな。\n見た目は可愛いかもしれないけど。", "zh": "浴池里的泡泡……总觉得会黏黏的。\n虽然看起来或许会很可爱啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "a46e64834547dbb77a01d7cce65e1075fa39c3d6cd27935e91316653a180f5b2", "ja": "えーっ、ダメですか？\nかわいいと思ったんだけどな～。", "zh": "咦──不行吗？\n我觉得很可爱啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0113_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "cccd2888fef602a17b23e48bfdeefe31a21d430846cb728f4fdda28103eece1e", "ja": "でも、お菓子のお仕事なら、きっと楽しいですよね？\n私、がんばります♪", "zh": "不过，既然是跟糖果有关的工作，一定会很开心吧？\n我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
